          "text": "(እስመ ፡ ቅሩብ) ፡ ከዐረገ ፡ የተጻፈበት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ራእዩ ፡ የሚፈጸምበት ፡ ዘመኑ ፡ ቅርብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነውና ፡ ምነው ፡ ዛሬስ ፡ እንኳ ፡ ገና ፡ እ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንጅ ፡ ያይደለ ፡ ቅሩብ ፡ ዘመኑ ፡ አለ፡ቢሉ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፈጥኖ ፡ ይታየዋልና ፡ እንደ ፡ ቀረበ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁኖ ፡ ይታየዋልና ፡ እንዳይቀር ፡ ያው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቃልና ። ካረገ፡ የተጻፈበት፡ በ፩፡ በ፪፡ በ፯ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false,
          "stage1_text": "ቃልና ። ካረገ፡ የተጻፈበት፡ በ፩፡ በ፪፡ በ፱ ፡",
          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "በ፱ -> በ፯",
            "reason": "The third Ethiopic numeral is ፯ (7), misread as ፱ (9)."
          },
          "uncertain": []
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወዝንቱ፡ ቃልስ ፡ እሙን ፡ ውእቱ ፡ እንዲ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true,
          "stage1_text": "ወዝንቱ፡ ሣልሱ ፡ እመን ፡ ውእቱ ፡ እንዲ",
          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "ሣልሱ ፡ እመን -> ቃልስ ፡ እሙን",
            "reason": "Canonical Ge'ez quote from Rev 22:6 ('ወዝንቱ ቃልስ እሙን ውእቱ'): 'ቃልስ' was misread as 'ሣልሱ' and 'እሙን' (faithful/true) was misread as 'እመን'."
          },
          "uncertain": []
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ል ፡ በ፯ ፡ ም ፡ ፳፪ ፡ ፮ ። ም ፡ ፳፪ ፡ ፲ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false,
          "stage1_text": "ል ፡ በ፱ ፡ ም ፡ ፳፪ ፡ ፮ ። ም ፡ ፳፪ ፡ ፲ ።",
          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "በ፱ -> በ፯",
            "reason": "The numeral is ፯ (7), matching L25, misread as ፱ (9)."
          },
          "uncertain": []
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": "፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፬ ፤ ዘጸሐፈ ፡ ዮሐንስ ፡ ለሰብዑ ፡ አብያተ፡ ክርስቲ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያናት ፡ እለ ፡ ውስተ ፡ እስያ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘጸሐፈ ፡ ወጸሐፈ ፡ ጸሐፈ ፡ ይላል ፥ ጸሐ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፍኩ፡ ሲል፡ (ጥቅ)፡ ይጽሕፍ፡ አቡሊዲስ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለእግዚኡ፡ ወለፍቁሩ፡ በርደጊስ፡ ወእመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይመጽእ፡ እንዲል። እስከዚህ ፡ አርእስት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ፥ እሱ ፡ ዘጸሐፈ ፡ ብሎ፡ ይዠምራል ፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በእስያ ፡ በሰባቱ ፡ አህጉር ፡ ላሉ ፡ ምእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 36,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መናን ፡ የጻፍሁት ፡ ራእይ ፡ ይህ ፡ ነው ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 37,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይህን ፡ ራእይ ፡ ጻፍሁ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ሞገሱ ፡ ለክሙ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሃይማኖት ፡ ይጽናላችሁ ። (ጥቅ)፡ ኢትግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድፉ ፡ሞገሰክሙ ፡ እንዲል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወሰላሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምግባር ፡ ይፈጸምላችሁ ፡ ባንድ ፡ ዘይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቤስ ፡ ሁለት ፡ ንባብ ፡ አያስፈታም ፡ ብሎ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሞገሱ። ባለሟልነት ። ወሰላሙ ፡ ፍቅር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድነት ፡ ይደረግላችሁ ፡ (ጥቅ) ፡ እምድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኅረ ፡ ሰላመ ፡ ርእሱ ፡ ባልሐነ ፡ ወሰላመ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እግዚአብሔር ፡ እንተ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ባቲ ፡ እን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዲል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እምኀበ ፡ ዘሀሎ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቅድመ ፡ ዓለም ፡ ከነበረ ፡ ከአብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወይሄሉ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓለምን ፡ አሳልፎ ፡ ከሚኖር ፡ ከአብ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘመጽአ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለኵነተ ፡ ሥጋ ፡ ከመጣ ፡ ከወልድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዘይመጽእ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓለሙን፡ ለማሳለፍ፡ ከሚመጣ፡ ከወልድ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ አንድ ፡ ወገን ፡ ቅድመ ፡ ዓለም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከነበረ ፡ ከወልድ ። ወይሄሉ ፡ ዓለሙን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሳልፎ ፡ ከሚኖር ፡ ከወልድ ። ዘመጽአ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለኵነተ ፡ ሥጋ ፡ ከመጣ ፡ ከወልድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወዘይመጽእ ፡ ዳግመኛ ፡ ዓለሙን ፡ ለማ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሳለፍ ፡ ከሚመጣ ፡ ከወልድ ፡ ይደረግላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ችሁ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእምነ ፡ ሰብዐቱ ፡ መንፈሰ ፡ ዘቅድመ ፡ መንበሩ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኢየሱስ ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ህልውና፡ ካለ ፡ ከመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ ይደረግላችሁ፡ ሐተታ፡ ሰብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዐቱ ፡ አለ ፡ ስለ፡ ፍጹም፡ ሀብቱ ፡(ጥቅ)፡እስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መ ፡ ኍልቍ ፡ ሰብዐቱ ፡ በኀበ ፡ ዕብራው",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያን ፡ፍጹም፡ ውእቱ ፡ እንዲል ። ወእምነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰብዐቱ ፡ መኃትው ፡ ዘቅድመ ፡ መንበሩ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሎ ፡ ኋላ ፡ ያመጣዋል ። አንድም ፡ ፍጹ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ ሀብተ ፡ መንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ ከጌትነቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሚሰጥ ፡ ከወልድ ፡ ይደረግላችሁ ፡ ዘመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽአ ፡ ወዘይመጽእ ፡ ብሎ፡ ሁለት ፡ አርእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስት ፡ ተናግሯል ፡ ለሁለቱም ፡ ያመጣል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘፀአ ፡ ፫ ፡ ፲፬ ፥ ፲፭ ። ዕብ ፡ ፲፫ ፡ ፰ ። ም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፫ ፡ ፩ ። ኢሳ ፡ ፲፩ ፡ ፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": "፭",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፭ ፤ ዘውእቱ ፡ ስምዕ ፡ መሃይምን ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘመጽአ ፡ ላለው ፡ አመጣ ፡ የታመነ ፡ ምስ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ክር ። አንድም ፡ ስምዕ ፡ ምስክር ፡ ወመሃ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይምን ፡ የታመነ ። አንድም ፡ ስምዐ ፡ መሃ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይምናን ፡ ይላል ፡ ምእመናን ፡ አምልኮ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቱን ፡ የሚመሰክሩለት፡(ጥቅ) ፡ ወእነግር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስምዐከ ፡ በቅድመ ፡ ነገሥት ፡ እንዲል ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወውእቱ ፡ ቀደመ ፡ በኵረ ፡ ከዊነ ፡ እምነ ፡ ምውታን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘተንሥአ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኵር ፡ መሆንን ፡ የዠመረ ፡ ወዘእሙ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታን ፡ ከሙታንም ፡ ተለይቶ ፡ የተነሣ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አንድም ፡ በኵር ፡ ሁኖ ፡ ቀደመ ፡ ከዊነ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዊንን ፡ የዠመረ ፡ ከዊንም ፡ ያልሁት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከሙታን ፡ ተለይቶ ፡ የተነሣው ፡ መነ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሣት ፡ ነው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወውእቱ ፡ መኰንኖሙ ፡ ለነገሥተ ፡ ምድር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘመጽአ ፡ ላለው ፡ ተናግሮ ፡ ወዘይመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽእ ፡ ላለው ፡ አመጣ ፡ የዚህን ፡ ዓለም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነገሥታት ፡ ከፈረሱ ፡ ከበሰበሱ ፡ በኋላ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አስነሥቶ ፡ የሚገዛ ፡ ይህንስ ፡ አሁን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ናሁ ፡ ይመጽእ ፡ በደመና ፡ ሰማይ ፡ ብሎ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያመጣዋል ፡ ብሎ ፡ አንድ ፡ ወገን ፡ ዘመ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጽአ ፡ ላለው ። አንድም ፡ የዚህን ፡ ዓለም ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነገሥታት ፡ እየሾመ ፡ እየሸለመ፡ የሚገዛ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "(ጥቅ)፡ አእምር ፡ ከመ፡ ልዑል ፡ ይኴንን ፥",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መንግሥተ ፡ ደቂቀ ፡ እጓለ ፡ እመሕያው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወለዘፈቀደ ፡ ይሁብ ፡ እስመ ፡ ኢይሠ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 35,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የም ፡ መኰንን ፡ ዘእንበለ ፡ እምኀበ ፡ እግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        }
